{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Action Button" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作按钮"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "動作按鈕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Poki and starts talking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 并开始说话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 Poki 並開始說話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Poki and starts talking. If Poki is doing a task, it shows that task and leaves it running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 并开始说话。Poki 正在做任务时，显示这个任务，任务继续进行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 Poki 並開始說話。Poki 正在做任務時，顯示這個任務，任務繼續進行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki couldn’t start the task. The chat says why." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 没能开始这个任务，原因在聊天里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 沒能開始這個任務，原因在聊天裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is still busy, so this task didn’t start. Here is what Poki is doing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 还在忙，这个任务没有开始。这里是 Poki 正在做的事。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 還在忙，這個任務沒有開始。這裡是 Poki 正在做的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is busy. Wait for the current task to finish and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在忙，请等当前任务结束后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在忙，請等目前的任務結束後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a model in Poki’s settings, then return to Split View and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在 Poki 的设置里选择模型，再回到分屏重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先在 Poki 的設定裡選擇模型，再回到分割顯示重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki started the task. Turn Poki on so it can act on the phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已开始这个任务。开启 Poki 后它才能操作手机。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已開始這個任務。開啟 Poki 後它才能操作手機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki starts the task on this iPhone and tells you when it is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在这台 iPhone 上开始做这个任务，做完后告诉你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在這台 iPhone 上開始做這個任務，做完後告訴你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki wasn’t ready. Try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 还没准备好，请稍后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 還沒準備好，請稍後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and hold the Action button to talk with Poki without leaving the app you’re in. Press and hold it again to end the talk. To open Poki and talk there instead, choose Controls, then Talk to Poki. To type a task, choose Shortcut, then Send Task. Control Center and the Lock Screen can hold Talk to Poki too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住操作按钮，不离开当前 App 就能和 Poki 说话，再按住一次就结束。想打开 Poki 在里面说话，选「控制」，再选「和 Poki 说话」。想输入任务，选「快捷指令」，再选「发送任务」。控制中心和锁定屏幕也可以放「和 Poki 说话」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住動作按鈕，不離開目前的 App 就能和 Poki 說話，再按住一次就結束。想打開 Poki 在裡面說話，選「控制項目」，再選「和 Poki 說話」。想輸入任務，選「捷徑」，再選「傳送任務」。控制中心和鎖定畫面也可以放「和 Poki 說話」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send ${task} to Poki" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ${task} 发给 Poki"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ${task} 發給 Poki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send Task" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发任务"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "發任務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Poki with on-device automation, then open the two apps in Split View and run the shortcut again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先打开 Poki 并启用本机自动化，再将两个 App 摆成分屏，然后重新运行快捷指令。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先開啟 Poki 並啟用裝置上的自動化，再以分割顯示開啟兩個 App，然後重新執行捷徑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Split View" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用分屏"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用分割顯示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send Task to Poki" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给 Poki 发任务"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "給 Poki 發任務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings › Action Button › Shortcut › Poki Anytime" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 › 操作按钮 › 快捷指令 › 随时 Poki"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定 › 動作按鈕 › 捷徑 › 隨時 Poki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to Poki" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "和 Poki 说话"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "和 Poki 說話"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Task" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should Poki do?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要 Poki 做什么？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要 Poki 做什麼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki Anytime" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随时 Poki"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隨時 Poki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts talking with Poki without leaving the app you’re in. Poki can see that app and work in it. Run it again to end the talk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不离开当前 App，直接和 Poki 说话。Poki 能看到这个 App，也能在里面操作。再运行一次就结束对话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不離開目前的 App，直接和 Poki 說話。Poki 能看到這個 App，也能在裡面操作。再執行一次就結束對話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki couldn’t show the talk on the Lock Screen, so it opens to talk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 没能在锁定屏幕上显示对话，所以打开 Poki 来说话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 沒能在鎖定畫面上顯示對話，所以打開 Poki 來說話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish setting up Poki first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先完成 Poki 的设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先完成 Poki 的設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Poki’s voice first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先设置 Poki 的语音。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先設定 Poki 的語音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is doing a task. Here it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在做任务，这是它在做的事。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在做任務，這是它在做的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The opening recording didn’t go through." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刚才那段录音没有送出去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剛才那段錄音沒有送出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice couldn’t connect. I’ll handle this as text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音没连上，我会按文字任务处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "語音沒連上，我會按文字任務處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Poki to allow on-device speech recognition for when voice can’t connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 授权本机听写，以便语音接不通时把录音转成文字。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 Poki 授權本機聽寫，以便語音接不通時把錄音轉成文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice couldn’t connect, and I couldn’t turn the recording into text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音没连上，也没法转文字。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "語音沒連上，也沒辦法轉成文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Poki to use the microphone first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先允许 Poki 使用麦克风。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先允許 Poki 使用麥克風。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
